    "intro_html":  "A Hong Kong cafe classic: crispy pan-fried pork chops over egg fried rice, smothered in a sweet-tangy tomato sauce and baked under melted cheese. Each serving brings \u003cstrong\u003e42 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.70\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). It sounds fancy. It costs less than a value meal.",
